            Case ui3IconBullets
                If legacy Then codePoint = &HE133& Else codePoint = &HE8FD&
            Case ui3IconCalculator
                If legacy Then codePoint = &HE1D0& Else codePoint = &HE8EF&
            Case ui3IconCalendar
                If legacy Then codePoint = &HE163& Else codePoint = &HE787&
            Case ui3IconCalendarDay
